    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "origin_pos": 23,
        "id": "Ji6tziV0qWrF"
      },
      "source": [
        "Now we can **implement the cross-entropy loss function** efficiently with just one line of code.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "iSgRzJ46pqFx"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Code: `cross_entropy_loss`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "origin_pos": 24,
        "tab": [
          "pytorch"
        ],
        "id": "bzmEvB4xqWrF",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "51c4121b-8212-49d9-c5dd-7ffe1f975c27"
      },
      "source": [
        "def cross_entropy_loss (y_hat, y):\n",
        "\n",
        "    return -torch.log(y_hat[range(len(y_hat)), y])\n",
        "    #range(len(y_hat)) creates indices 0,1,2,len-1\n",
        "\n",
        "cross_entropy_loss (y_hat, y)\n"
      ],
      "execution_count": 48,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "tensor([2.3026, 0.6931])"
            ]
          },
