        "## Prediction\n",
        "\n",
        "Now that training is complete, our model is ready to **classify some images.**\n",
        "Given a series of images, we will compare their actual labels (first line of text output) and the predictions from the model (second line of text output).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "IieOngQhx1Ll"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Code: `predict`"
      ]
    },
